 "description": "<p>The 2-in-1 formula in its plainest form: vibration frequencies on one channel, a licking function on the other, medical-grade silicone around both. No exotic modes to decode — the toy does the two things the category was built on and skips the gimmick layer.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_2_0f39a63a-18de-421b-af11-6e21e8f0303d_480x480.jpg?v=1692151988\"></p>\n<p>The battery numbers favor patience: seventy minutes on the magnetic charger returns about a hundred and ten minutes of use. Runtime beating charge time by half again is uncommon, and it changes the habit around the toy — charge while busy, use at leisure.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_5_9667ba12-cfdf-460a-b58e-ad485548d9a2_480x480.jpg?v=1692151998\"><br />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_7_46747061-5cfc-4dc3-a94b-87c9c41e0542_480x480.jpg?v=1692152002\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p>The 320mAh cell keeps weight down, and the sub-50 dB ceiling holds the motor below the threshold anyone outside the room would notice. As an entry into the rose category, the spec sheet reads as the version without a weak entry.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Functions: vibration + licking (2-in-1)</li>\n<li>Material: medical-grade silicone</li>\n<li>Battery: 320 mAh, 70 min charge / ~110 min use</li>\n<li>Charging: magnetic mode</li>\n<li>Noise: under 50 dB</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_4_098539e9-985d-4dc6-9334-a50e6c3a5630_480x480.jpg?v=1692151995\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_1_921b8b4f-e1df-4be7-91ae-64a5e6e7cf94_480x480.jpg?v=1692151985\"></p>\n<p>The reliable baseline rose — every number competent, nothing missing.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>2-in-1 rose vibrator with licking function, medical silicone body, 70-minute charge returning about 110 minutes of quiet use.</p>\n",
